# Hand-written -- the downloaded Leather_Stool.obj shipped with no .mtl at
# all (no mtllib/usemtl anywhere in the file), and no texture image either.
# `usemtl Leather` was inserted into Leather_Stool.obj right before its face
# list so this project's parser (which needs a usemtl to open a subset --
# see ModelRenderer::LoadObj) has something to draw. Plain solid leather-
# brown color, no texture.
newmtl Leather
Ns 40.000000
Ka 0.120000 0.070000 0.040000
Kd 0.360000 0.200000 0.110000
Ks 0.100000 0.080000 0.060000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
d 1.000000
illum 1
